{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "They do not answer immediately? - Not serious. They ask for a cheaper option? - Not serious. They say they are “just exploring”? - Definitely not serious. 😅", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001"}], "text": "Clients who do not answer immediately, ask for cheaper options, or say they are \"just exploring\" may be identified as \"not serious\" by sales agents."}, "title": "Identifying Not Serious Clients", "topic": "client_evaluation"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:knowledge:4973434d2a69e247", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Identifying Not Serious Clients", "topic": "client_evaluation", "topic_slug": "client_evaluation"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Ideally, give them enough time to completely forget they ever clicked on the advertisement.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001"}], "text": "Being too formal, like sending emails before making contact through WhatsApp, might cause potential clients to forget about their initial inquiry."}, "title": "Problems with Formality in Emails", "topic": "communication_strategy"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:knowledge:4dceee2e6095ea92", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Problems with Formality in Emails", "topic": "communication_strategy", "topic_slug": "communication_strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The problem is that you still do not know how to lead the conversation when the client says something unexpected.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000002"}], "text": "Searching for market-specific scripts may not resolve client interaction issues; the real problem may be in handling unexpected client responses."}, "title": "Ineffectiveness of Scripts for Different Markets", "topic": "communication_strategy"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:knowledge:68edd36bbba6c520", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Ineffectiveness of Scripts for Different Markets", "topic": "communication_strategy", "topic_slug": "communication_strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "One of the agents in a recent coaching session told me this is exactly what he says to clients...Ads cost money and you just wasted it.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"}], "text": "Some agents have reportedly told clients that they wasted advertising money by not being interested after clicking on an ad, which can lead to losing the client."}, "title": "Interaction Mistake: Blaming Clients for Advertising Costs", "topic": "communication_mistakes"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:knowledge:286e148c5d1bd84d", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Interaction Mistake: Blaming Clients for Advertising Costs", "topic": "communication_mistakes", "topic_slug": "communication_mistakes"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The goal is not to memorise every possible answer. It is to understand how to lead the conversation.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000004"}], "text": "The goal in client interactions should not be to memorize answers but to understand how to lead conversations effectively."}, "title": "Focus on Leading Conversation", "topic": "conversation_skills"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:knowledge:7382bf288a164c3d", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Focus on Leading Conversation", "topic": "conversation_skills", "topic_slug": "conversation_skills"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "The client says: We’re not interested anymore.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"}], "text": "Clients say they are not interested anymore."}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": {"citations": [{"quote": "You won the argument. And lost the client.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"}], "text": "The agent wins the argument but loses the client."}, "rationale": null, "response": {"citations": [{"quote": "Then you shouldn’t have clicked on the advertisement. Ads cost money and you just wasted it.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"}], "text": "The agent says clients shouldn't have clicked on the advertisement if they weren't interested, implicitly blaming them for wasting money."}, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "One of the agents in a recent coaching session told me this is exactly what he says to clients...Ads cost money and you just wasted it.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"}], "text": "An agent reacts to clients who say they are not interested by blaming them for wasting advertising money."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Agent Blaming Clients for Ad Costs", "topic": "communication_mistakes"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:cases:acfe48138761b35b", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Agent Blaming Clients for Ad Costs", "topic": "communication_mistakes", "topic_slug": "communication_mistakes"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001"], "form": "tone", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Please follow carefully. 😇 Bad advice #1: Before you WhatsApp the lead, send an email first. Especially if they are European or American.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001"}], "text": "The text uses sarcasm and humor to critique conventional sales advice by labeling them as 'Bad advice.'"}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Humor and Irony in Sales Tips", "topic": "communication_strategy"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:expression:f95798f46c8b6b7b", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Humor and Irony in Sales Tips", "topic": "communication_strategy", "topic_slug": "communication_strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001", "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000002", "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Bad advice #1: Before you WhatsApp the lead,", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001"}, {"quote": "Bad advice #2: If you call, speak REALLY fast.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000001"}, {"quote": "Bad advice #3: Keep looking for the perfect script for every client.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000002"}, {"quote": "Bad advice #4: If they say they are not interested, tell them they just wasted your advertising money.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"}], "text": "The author lists incorrect sales advice sequentially, using numbers to differentiate each piece of bad advice."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Sequential Listing of Bad Advice", "topic": "communication_mistakes"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:expression:f09bbf3e5a6506a7", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Sequential Listing of Bad Advice", "topic": "communication_mistakes", "topic_slug": "communication_mistakes"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003", "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000004"], "form": "tone", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "And no, I am not exaggerating.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000003"}, {"quote": "And if any of these “sales tips” felt slightly too familiar 😂, share this post with someone who might urgently need them.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:u000004"}], "text": "The text employs sarcasm by praising poor sales tactics to emphasize their ineffectiveness, and then transitions with a corrective perspective."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Sarcastic Structure in Text", "topic": "communication_strategy"}, "content_hash": "3e3f2110c52d5b32728116e91519911aefd6caefe183d65e3705e8b861d48748", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f:expression:2ce0a8c59ec33e48", "metadata_hash": "bc623796d5474602cee3275a7298db94bf47b8b5fa7e9b0126e0c1ceb088037d", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-25T02:58:33.252000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "0f790b820e183f2739f4a986ec4b82ed24ab675ae53d00e03d05deb5918ca639", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-09-25-how-to-spot-a-not-md-9cfd139d2f", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_dubairealestate-dubairealestatesales-realestatesalescoach-activity-7509083897733808128-ElBQ", "title": "Sarcastic Structure in Text", "topic": "communication_strategy", "topic_slug": "communication_strategy"}
